  message: "Fixed in PR #3658. New TEST_FILE_PATTERNS_DIR_OVERRIDE list in supply_chain.py checked BEFORE TEST_DIR_PATTERNS. Currently contains only `_test\\.exs$`; routes Phoenix/Elixir test files (test/<ctx>/<thing>_test.exs) to tier 1 (FIRST_PARTY) with is_test=True instead of tier 2 (INTERNAL_DEP). Resolves the bakeoff-deep cohort 1 reflect FCA concept leak (1328/1328 phoenix tier=2 nodes were tests, 0 vendored). +4 property tests covering Phoenix layout shapes and auxiliary-file fall-through guards. Narrow scope by design — broader 'should tests appear on tier axis at all' question deferred per WI."  # 75a0
